    "16534818921d9da639": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "1653481892aca601d3-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I wash my Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The <strong>Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper</strong> features a removable, machine-washable cover, making it easy to keep your sleep surface fresh and clean.</p><p>The memory foam core itself should never be placed in a washing machine or fully submerged in water, as excess moisture can damage the foam.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "1653481892aca601d3-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How do I remove the cover for washing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Remove your bedding and Mattress Protector, then unzip the Wanderluxe™ cover and carefully remove it from the memory foam core.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_JCdeMT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I wash the removable cover?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Always remove the memory foam insert and close the zipper before washing your Wanderluxe™ cover.</p><p>Machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle using a mild detergent. Do not bleach.</p><p>Once washed, line dry or tumble dry on low. Make sure the cover is completely dry before placing it back over the memory foam insert.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_JeDm9J": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How do I clean the memory foam insert?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The memory foam insert cannot be machine washed or submerged in water.</p><p>If needed, spot clean only using a mild detergent and warm soapy water. Do not wring the foam. Gently squeeze out any excess moisture and allow it to dry thoroughly in the shade before replacing the cover or using your topper again.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_A3c9cP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How can I protect my topper from spills and accidents?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>We recommend using a <strong>Dreamer RV Waterproof Mattress Protector</strong> over your topper and mattress.</p><p>As well as helping protect against spills and accidents, the protector creates an additional barrier between your topper and everyday moisture, helping keep your Wanderluxe™ fresh and protected for longer.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "1653481892aca601d3-0",
