    "section_faq_qrCBHp": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_kBPXrG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I wash my MeanderWild caravan sheets?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Machine wash your MeanderWild sheets in cold water on a gentle cycle using a mild liquid detergent.</p><p>Cold water and a gentle wash help protect the fibres and maintain the quality, softness and fit of your sheets over time.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_i7fMtm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I use bleach or fabric softener?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>No. We recommend avoiding both bleach and fabric softeners, as they can damage the fibres and affect the quality and longevity of your sheets.&nbsp;<br/>A mild liquid laundry detergent is all you need to keep them fresh and clean.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_JrYHCi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I dry my sheets?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Whenever possible, we recommend line drying your MeanderWild sheets. This is a gentle way to dry the fabric and helps minimise the risk of shrinkage.</p><p>If line drying isn’t an option, your sheets can be tumble dried on a low heat setting. Avoid high temperatures, as excessive heat may cause shrinkage or damage to the fabric.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_ngxRwm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Should I wash my MeanderWild sheets before first use?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. We recommend giving your MeanderWild sheets a cold, gentle wash before their first use.</p><p>This helps freshen the fabric after manufacturing and packaging and prepares your new sheets for their first night on the bed.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_y69W6V": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I iron my MeanderWild sheets?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>If ironing is required, check the care label on your sheets and follow the temperature instructions provided.<br/>For everyday use, removing your sheets promptly from the washing machine and allowing them to dry naturally can also help minimise creasing.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_XTbbQJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I store my sheets when they’re not being used?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Make sure your sheets are completely clean and dry before storing them in a cool, dry and well-ventilated place.</p><p>Avoid storing damp bedding or leaving sheets in areas where moisture can build up, as this may encourage mildew or unwanted odours — particularly inside a caravan being stored for an extended period.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_FmEQVQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How can I keep my MeanderWild sheets feeling their best?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>A little gentle care goes a long way. Wash your sheets in cold water on a gentle cycle, use a mild liquid detergent, avoid bleach and fabric softeners, and line dry whenever possible.</p><p>Following these simple care instructions will help preserve the comfort, fit and quality of your MeanderWild caravan sheets for plenty of adventures to come.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
