    "section_faq_xRNVKL": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_QaeMNx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do I need to air my topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. We recommend giving your Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper some time to air when you first unbox it.<br/>As the topper has been compressed for shipping, you may notice a slight “new foam” smell when it is first opened. This is normal and should naturally dissipate with fresh air and ventilation.<br/><br/>Once in use, giving your topper an opportunity to air from time to time can also help keep it fresh, particularly when travelling in warm or humid conditions.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_xWmH9U": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I use an electric blanket with my Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. Your electric blanket should be placed on top of your Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper and Mattress Protector, and underneath your fitted sheet.</p><p>Before use, always check the care and safety instructions provided by your electric blanket manufacturer to ensure it is suitable for use with a memory foam mattress topper, and follow their recommended usage guidelines.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_t8zVtP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I use my Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper with a folding or hybrid-style bed?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. Wanderluxe™ Mattress Toppers can be used with folding and hybrid-style beds, provided there is enough space for the topper to fold comfortably and be stowed within the bed cavity while travelling.</p><p>For extended storage periods of one month or more, we recommend removing the topper from the bed and rolling it for storage rather than leaving it folded or compressed.</p><p>If your topper has been folded or compressed for more than a day or two, allow up to 12 hours for the memory foam to fully regain its shape before use.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
